# Cloudflare Pages routing rules.

# Guard: build/ is the PRIVATE pipeline repo that sits inside this one. Deploying the
# repo root with `wrangler pages deploy .` uploads it, which published
# build/README.md and build/verify-report.txt on 2026-08-12. Redirect rules are
# followed whether or not an asset matches, so this keeps those paths unreachable
# even when the files are uploaded by mistake. Deploy with ./deploy.sh, which stages
# a clean tree; this line is the second layer.
/build/* / 301

# The plate bibliography was 27 letter pages until 2026-08-17 and is now a single
# searchable document. The letter URLs were in sitemap-hubs.xml and were indexed,
# so they are redirected rather than left to 404. The splat is scoped one level
# below /symbols/plates/ so it cannot swallow /symbols/plates/ itself — a rule
# that collides with a real filename is what 308-looped the fonts on 2026-08-14.
/symbols/plates/:letter /symbols/plates/ 301
/symbols/plates/:letter/* /symbols/plates/ 301

# The United Kingdom guide retired 2026-08-23, on Cat's instruction: England, Scotland,
# Wales and Northern Ireland each have a page now, and the Republic of Ireland its own.
# ABOVE the generated marker on purpose: species/generate.js rebuilds that block with
# body.split(START)[0], so anything below the marker is deleted on the next species run.
/trips/united-kingdom/ /trips/ 301
/trips/united-kingdom /trips/ 301

